DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
27794::$$$message_0206_0000_0000$$$::   Okay.[lr]::
27795::$$$message_0206_0000_0001$$$::A lot's happened, but it's time to take a bath!::
27796::$$$message_0206_0001_0000$$$::"Whew. Finally, a break..."[lr]::
27797::$$$message_0206_0001_0001$$$::The day's over and I rest my tired body.[lr]::
27798::$$$message_0206_0001_0002$$$::It's been half a year since the female population increased in my house.[lr]::
27799::$$$message_0206_0001_0003$$$::Every day is fun and vibrant, but there are times I just want to relax on my own.::
27800::$$$message_0206_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, Shirou?"[lr]::
27801::$$$message_0206_0002_0001$$$::"...Huh?"::
27802::$$$message_0206_0003_0000$$$::"S-sorry!"[lr]::
27803::$$$message_0206_0003_0001$$$::I-I-I got distracted...![lr]::
27804::$$$message_0206_0003_0002$$$::I'm normally so careful! How could I make the same mistake again!?::
27805::$$$message_0206_0004_0000$$$::"...I'm terribly sorry.[lr]::
27806::$$$message_0206_0004_0001$$$::I don't know why you came to apologize to me, but as you can see, the bathroom is currently occupied."[lr]::
27807::$$$message_0206_0004_0002$$$::"I can't see! I'm not looking! The bubbles are in the way and I can only see your general outline, so you're s-s-still totally safe!"::
27808::$$$message_0206_0005_0000$$$::"Yes, so if it isn't urgent, we can talk afterward."[lr]::
27809::$$$message_0206_0005_0001$$$::"Right! I didn't do this on purpose!"[lr]::
27810::$$$message_0206_0005_0002$$$::"I see."[lr]::
27811::$$$message_0206_0005_0003$$$::"Yeah! Whew, I'm sure glad you're so understanding!"::
27812::$$$message_0206_0006_0000$$$::I shout with joy.[lr]::
27813::$$$message_0206_0006_0001$$$::Thank goodness. If I'd been a second too slow to respond, I would've hit an instant Game Over!::
27814::$$$message_0206_0007_0000$$$::"...I'm sorry, I don't understand."[lr]::
27815::$$$message_0206_0007_0001$$$::"No no, I didn't know you were already inside, either."[lr]::
27816::$$$message_0206_0007_0002$$$::"If you'd checked the dressing room, you would have realized that."[lr]::
27817::$$$message_0206_0007_0003$$$::"...Argh."::
27818::$$$message_0206_0008_0000$$$::We're both stark naked, but she's the only one who's staying calm.[lr]::
27819::$$$message_0206_0008_0001$$$::I still haven't managed to shake off the initial shock.::
27820::$$$message_0206_0009_0000$$$::"S-sorry I didn't notice. I'll leave right now."[lr]::
27821::$$$message_0206_0009_0001$$$::The only saving grace is that she wasn't Sakura or Tohsaka.[lr]::
27822::$$$message_0206_0009_0002$$$::If it had been one of them, there would have been screams, and calamity would have befallen this household.::
27823::$$$message_0206_0010_0000$$$::"R-right, I'll apologize another time."[lr]::
27824::$$$message_0206_0010_0001$$$::I awkwardly turn on my heel to leave.[lr]::
27825::$$$message_0206_0010_0002$$$::"...!?"[lr]::
27826::$$$message_0206_0010_0003$$$::Only my hip rotates.[lr]::
27827::$$$message_0206_0010_0004$$$::For some reason, my other foot won't come along.::
27828::$$$message_0206_0011_0000$$$::"Shirou?"[lr]::
27829::$$$message_0206_0011_0001$$$::I dramatically lose my balance, and I brace myself in anticipation of the pain that I'll feel from colliding with the ground.[lr]::
27830::$$$message_0206_0011_0002$$$::But somehow, I don't fall, as if the back of my feet are stuck to the tiles...::
27831::$$$message_0206_0012_0000$$$::"No...way..."[lr]::
27832::$$$message_0206_0012_0001$$$::They're actually stuck.[lr]::
27833::$$$message_0206_0012_0002$$$::I can't feel anything below my thighs, and my feet look like they're growing out of the floor.::
27834::$$$message_0206_0013_0000$$$::"What's wrong, Shirou?"::
27835::$$$message_0206_0014_0000$$$::"Rider...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]...[wvl canskip=0 time=400] Where are your glasses?"[lr]::
27836::$$$message_0206_0014_0001$$$::"Oh, you mean the Mystic Eye Killers?"[lr]::
27837::$$$message_0206_0014_0002$$$::"Yeah, those."[lr]::
27838::$$$message_0206_0014_0003$$$::"They fog up in the bath, so I took them off."::
27839::$$$message_0206_0015_0000$$$::"Ahh...makes sense.[lr]::
27840::$$$message_0206_0015_0001$$$::It would be hard to see in the bath with glasses on."::
27841::$$$message_0206_0016_0000$$$::"Yes, and there is usually no one in here that could accidentally peer into my Mystic Eyes, so there should be no danger in taking them off."[lr]::
27842::$$$message_0206_0016_0001$$$::Hahaha. Other than dumb intruders like me.::
27843::$$$message_0206_0017_0000$$$::"...Urgh. I guess I'm not the only one who spaces out in the bath."[lr]::
27844::$$$message_0206_0017_0001$$$::"Mystic Eyes[wvl canskip=0 time=400]...[cacheimage storage=white][wvl canskip=0 time=400]...ah. [movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=c accel=0 storage=white textoff=0 rule=円形(中から外へ)][wm canskip=0][se storage=se132.wav][cacheimage storage=fd21f][wvl canskip=0 time=600][stopdash][fadein time=800 storage=fd21f cleardash=1]Shirou!?"[lr]::
27845::$$$message_0206_0017_0002$$$::Her eyes are wide in astonishment, which I don't see very often.[lr]::
27846::$$$message_0206_0017_0003$$$::"Idi...! Hold on, don't look at me, Rider!"::
27847::$$$message_0206_0018_0000$$$::It doesn't matter if I close my eyes.[lr]::
27848::$$$message_0206_0018_0001$$$::Rider's curse of petrification affects everything she looks at.::
27849::$$$message_0206_0019_0000$$$::"...No, it's too late.[lr]::
27850::$$$message_0206_0019_0001$$$::I've closed my eyes, but the petrified portions will not heal."[lr]::
27851::$$$message_0206_0019_0002$$$::"You're kidding...!"[lr]::
27852::$$$message_0206_0019_0003$$$::"...I'd prefer it if you didn't raise your voice.[lr]::
27853::$$$message_0206_0019_0004$$$::If Sakura comes running, she will misunderstand."::
27854::$$$message_0206_0020_0000$$$::"Oh, right... Hey, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=600 count=-3]it's already up to my waist![lr]::
27855::$$$message_0206_0020_0001$$$::Even the towel I was wearing is stone now... How does it work, anyway?"[lr]::
27856::$$$message_0206_0020_0002$$$::"It's all right. Although the effect differs by individual, it generally causes the same phenomenon in everyone.[lr]::
27857::$$$message_0206_0020_0003$$$::You must feel uneasy not understanding its mechanism. But it is a natural phenomenon, so there's no need to be anxious, ashamed, or worried."::
27858::$$$message_0206_0021_0000$$$::"What are you talking about!? Do something, please!"[lr]::
27859::$$$message_0206_0021_0001$$$::"Haah. You leave me no choice."[lr]::
27860::$$$message_0206_0021_0002$$$::Rider shakes her head, her river of purple hair swaying. She turns to face the mirror on the wall.::
27861::$$$message_0206_0022_0000$$$::"I don't like mirrors, so I'm loath to do this, but..."[lr]::
27862::$$$message_0206_0022_0001$$$::In the mirror, her eyes turn bloodshot.[lr]::
27863::$$$message_0206_0022_0002$$$::Then, the creeping petrification stops, as if cut off at its source.::
27864::$$$message_0206_0023_0000$$$::"Whew... Thanks, Rider."[lr]::
27865::$$$message_0206_0023_0001$$$::"In the early stages, it can be dispelled from a human body through magical means. You would have been in great danger had it reached your heart[line len=2][cacheimage storage=fd21c][wvl canskip=0 time=400][fadein time=400 storage=fd21c]Shirou?"[lr]::
27866::$$$message_0206_0023_0002$$$::Rider looks around helplessly, then timidly stands up.::
27867::$$$message_0206_0024_0000$$$::"What's wrong?"[lr]::
27868::$$$message_0206_0024_0001$$$::"...If you'll excuse me, I need to[line len=2]"[lr]::
27869::$$$message_0206_0024_0002$$$::"...!"[lr]::
27870::$$$message_0206_0024_0003$$$::"Whoa, look out!"[lr]::
27871::$$$message_0206_0024_0004$$$::Rider's soapy feet step on a bucket...and her naked body falls toward me.::
27872::$$$message_0206_0025_0000$$$::"...Ah."[lr]::
27873::$$$message_0206_0025_0001$$$::Her flushed, hot body envelopes the upper half of me that isn't petrified.[lr]::
27874::$$$message_0206_0025_0002$$$::I'm crushed beneath her voluminous chest. It feels like water balloons that were filled in the bath.::
27875::$$$message_0206_0026_0000$$$::"Ngh..."[lr]::
27876::$$$message_0206_0026_0001$$$::The uncontrollable excitement works my heart into a frenzy, driving the blood being forced back up from my petrified lower body into my brain at double speed.::
27877::$$$message_0206_0027_0000$$$::"Excuse me, Shirou."[lr]::
27878::$$$message_0206_0027_0001$$$::"Th-the mirror is over there! You're leaning on me!"[lr]::
27879::$$$message_0206_0027_0002$$$::"It seems the petrification is starting to wear off... Hmm, what a strange texture."[lr]::
27880::$$$message_0206_0027_0003$$$::"That's the bathtub. More importantly, your chest is[line len=2]uwaaah!"[lr]::
27881::$$$message_0206_0027_0004$$$::"Yes, I know. Please stay calm, Shirou."[lr]::
27882::$$$message_0206_0027_0005$$$::"That's the light[wvl canskip=0 time=400]... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Hey, are you doing this on purpose?"::
27883::$$$message_0206_0028_0000$$$::I take her slender hand, taking care not to look at her uncovered body.[lr]::
27884::$$$message_0206_0028_0001$$$::Rider is squinting at me, but she seems to be focusing on the wrong place.::
27885::$$$message_0206_0029_0000$$$::"Rider, how many fingers am I holding up?"[lr]::
27886::$$$message_0206_0029_0001$$$::"Two... Five...?"[lr]::
27887::$$$message_0206_0029_0002$$$::"You really can't see."::
27888::$$$message_0206_0030_0000$$$::"...Yes. I just used Gorgon to suppress my magical energy in order to weaken my Mystic Eyes, but I miscalculated and it impaired my eyesight as well."[lr]::
27889::$$$message_0206_0030_0001$$$::"Oh, it's my fault."::
27890::$$$message_0206_0031_0000$$$::"It's no cause for concern. My eyesight will recover once I dispel Gorgon.[lr]::
27891::$$$message_0206_0031_0001$$$::Shirou, I'm sorry for the trouble, but would you mind guiding me to the sink?"[lr]::
27892::$$$message_0206_0031_0002$$$::"You can't tell where it is even from this close?"[lr]::
27893::$$$message_0206_0031_0003$$$::Her sense of direction is so bad, you have to wonder how she normally runs around with a blindfold on.::
27894::$$$message_0206_0032_0000$$$::"Not yet. You still haven't rinsed the shampoo out of your hair.[lr]::
27895::$$$message_0206_0032_0001$$$::You were using the bath first, Rider, so go ahead and finish your bath. I'll keep my eyes closed."[lr]::
27896::$$$message_0206_0032_0002$$$::"With all due respect, I can't wash my hair if I can't see."[lr]::
27897::$$$message_0206_0032_0003$$$::...Rider, how have you gotten this far if you're that clum[line len=2]No, that isn't important now.::
27898::$$$message_0206_0033_0000$$$::"But since you cannot leave this room on your own, I have to be the one to leave first."[lr]::
27899::$$$message_0206_0033_0001$$$::"...No, I was the one who walked in on you.[lr]::
27900::$$$message_0206_0033_0002$$$::This doesn't make up for it, but since you were in the middle of washing, I'll wash your hair for you."::
27901::$$$message_0206_0034_0000$$$::"You'll wash...my hair?"[lr]::
27902::$$$message_0206_0034_0001$$$::I nod.[lr]::
27903::$$$message_0206_0034_0002$$$::My lower half is frozen, but my arms still move just fine.::
27904::$$$message_0206_0035_0000$$$::"...I see. It does take quite some effort to wash my hair by myself. Would you please help me, then?"[lr]::
27905::$$$message_0206_0035_0001$$$::"Sure thing. Okay, sit down right here. Face that way so I can see your whole back."[lr]::
27906::$$$message_0206_0035_0002$$$::"Mm...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]...[wvl canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se190.wav]... Ah, here's the chair."::
27907::$$$message_0206_0036_0000$$$::"No no, that's the wash basin...[wvl canskip=0 time=400] You fell into it!?"[lr]::
27908::$$$message_0206_0036_0001$$$::"Ngh...! It's so confusing."[lr]::
27909::$$$message_0206_0036_0002$$$::"It's going to break if you try to wrench it off like that."::
27910::$$$message_0206_0037_0000$$$::"Then I'll use my nails to tear the flesh of my buttocks out of it."[lr]::
27911::$$$message_0206_0037_0001$$$::"[font italic=true]Why!?[font italic=false]"[lr]::
27912::$$$message_0206_0037_0002$$$::"There's no other way."[lr]::
27913::$$$message_0206_0037_0003$$$::"No no no no, let's think about this a little more![lr]::
27914::$$$message_0206_0037_0004$$$::I know, use the body wash to lubricate yourself!"::
27915::$$$message_0206_0038_0000$$$::"I think it would be faster to just cut myself."[lr]::
27916::$$$message_0206_0038_0001$$$::"No cutting your butt or your head off!"[lr]::
27917::$$$message_0206_0038_0002$$$::"Phew."[lr]::
27918::$$$message_0206_0038_0003$$$::"How's your butt, Rider?"::
27919::$$$message_0206_0039_0000$$$::"Your quick wit saved it.[lr]::
27920::$$$message_0206_0039_0001$$$::[se storage=se190.wav]...Ah, so this shape is the chair."[lr]::
27921::$$$message_0206_0039_0002$$$::"Yep... Wait, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=2]wah! Don't face this way! Stop spreading your legs! [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=10 time=600 count=5]Other way! Other way! Face the opposite direction!"::
27922::$$$message_0206_0040_0000$$$::"Haah, it doesn't matter to me."[lr]::
27923::$$$message_0206_0040_0001$$$::"But it does to me! ...Seriously, just show me your back.[lr]::
27924::$$$message_0206_0040_0002$$$::And then...um...?"::
27925::$$$message_0206_0041_0000$$$::My hand hovers uncertainly over the forest of bottles.[lr]::
27926::$$$message_0206_0041_0001$$$::Saber, Tohsaka, and Rin each use different shampoos. Illya and Fuji-nee's personal bottles are mixed in with them, even though they don't even live here.::
27927::$$$message_0206_0042_0000$$$::"My bottle is the beige one."[lr]::
27928::$$$message_0206_0042_0001$$$::"The third from the right?"[wvs][se storage=se712.wav][lr]::
27929::$$$message_0206_0042_0002$$$::"This...one?"[lr]::
27930::$$$message_0206_0042_0003$$$::"No, two more to the left. That one?"[lr]::
27931::$$$message_0206_0042_0004$$$::"Hm, this one does feel like it...[wvl][se storage=se713.wav] Go ahead."[lr]::
27932::$$$message_0206_0042_0005$$$::It kinda feels like I'm moving her via remote control.::
27933::$$$message_0206_0043_0000$$$::"Okay... Don't be nervous."[lr]::
27934::$$$message_0206_0043_0001$$$::Her silken, slippery hair is wet, shining like it's made of silver threads.::
27935::$$$message_0206_0044_0000$$$::They say a woman's hair is her life. No wonder they're so picky about shampoo.[lr]::
27936::$$$message_0206_0044_0001$$$::How well it reacts with the scalp, whether it's moisturizing, whether it has 100% natural ingredients, whether it's paraben-free...[lr]::
27937::$$$message_0206_0044_0002$$$::Rider must be extra scrupulous, with such long and beautiful hair.::
27938::$$$message_0206_0045_0000$$$::"What's wrong, Shirou?"[lr]::
27939::$$$message_0206_0045_0001$$$::"Aaagh, stupid, stop being so conscious of her... Um, this is body wash."[lr]::
27940::$$$message_0206_0045_0002$$$::"Yes, I use that to wash my entire body."[lr]::
27941::$$$message_0206_0045_0003$$$::...I feel like I'm in a gym locker room.::
27942::$$$message_0206_0046_0000$$$::"Why are you using that on your hair!?"[lr]::
27943::$$$message_0206_0046_0001$$$::"I thought that was sufficient... What's wrong with it?"[lr]::
27944::$$$message_0206_0046_0002$$$::Take better care of yourself, please.[lr]::
27945::$$$message_0206_0046_0003$$$::It would be such a huge waste if she were to ruin her beautifully glossy hair!::
27946::$$$message_0206_0047_0000$$$::"...Good grief.[lr]::
27947::$$$message_0206_0047_0001$$$::Rider, hand me the third and fourth bottles from the left."[lr]::
27948::$$$message_0206_0047_0002$$$::"Aren't these Rin's?"[lr]::
27949::$$$message_0206_0047_0003$$$::"I'm allowing it today, as head of the house."[lr]::
27950::$$$message_0206_0047_0004$$$::I'll use Tohsaka's expensive-looking shampoo to give Rider's hair a good wash.::
27951::$$$message_0206_0048_0000$$$::I squirt the liquids into my hand.[lr]::
27952::$$$message_0206_0048_0001$$$::I wonder how much I should use for all this hair...[lr]::
27953::$$$message_0206_0048_0002$$$::Well, more can't hurt.::
27954::$$$message_0206_0049_0000$$$::"Okay, I'm going to start from the top."[lr]::
27955::$$$message_0206_0049_0001$$$::"Please do...[cacheimage storage=fd21b][wvl][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=2][fadein time=400 storage=fd21b cleardash=1][stopdash]...mm."[lr]::
27956::$$$message_0206_0049_0002$$$::Rider stiffens, as if surprised by the cool shampoo.[lr]::
27957::$$$message_0206_0049_0003$$$::I work it in, coating her hair evenly, and agitate it with my fingers.::
27958::$$$message_0206_0050_0000$$$::"Now that I'm holding it, you sure do have a lot of hair."[lr]::
27959::$$$message_0206_0050_0001$$$::"Yes. It becomes heavier when it's wet.[lr]::
27960::$$$message_0206_0050_0002$$$::Suffice to say, it feels like it could wring my head from my shoulders."::
27961::$$$message_0206_0051_0000$$$::"Wow, that's a surreal image. Isn't it a lot of work to wash it by yourself?"[lr]::
27962::$$$message_0206_0051_0001$$$::"Well, yes... You can be rougher with it, if you want.[lr]::
27963::$$$message_0206_0051_0002$$$::Feel free to stop if you get tired midway. We can just wait until your petrification fades."::
27964::$$$message_0206_0052_0000$$$::"Don't be silly. We'll catch a cold if we stay here that long."[lr]::
27965::$$$message_0206_0052_0001$$$::"I won't catch a cold. As you can see, my body differs from that of a human."::
27966::$$$message_0206_0053_0000$$$::"Waaah!?"[lr]::
27967::$$$message_0206_0053_0001$$$::"A joke. On the outside, I look no different from a human."[lr]::
27968::$$$message_0206_0053_0002$$$::"I-I get it already, so you don't have to show me!"::
27969::$$$message_0206_0054_0000$$$::"...[lr]::
27970::$$$message_0206_0054_0001$$$::...Does my body displease you that much?"[lr]::
27971::$$$message_0206_0054_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
27972::$$$message_0206_0054_0003$$$::"No, nothing.[lr]::
27973::$$$message_0206_0054_0004$$$::I just wanted to make you happy, as an apology for your trouble."::
27974::$$$message_0206_0055_0000$$$::"Don't worry about it.[lr]::
27975::$$$message_0206_0055_0001$$$::This was all my fault to begin with, so it's weird that you're the one trying to apologize."[lr]::
27976::$$$message_0206_0055_0002$$$::"But..."[lr]::
27977::$$$message_0206_0055_0003$$$::"Besides, I'm having fun washing your hair."[lr]::
27978::$$$message_0206_0055_0004$$$::"My hair...? [cacheimage storage=fd21b][wvl canskip=0 time=200][fadein time=300 storage=fd21b textoff=0]Mmph."[lr]::
27979::$$$message_0206_0055_0005$$$::It's my first time washing someone else's hair, and there's enough of it that it's worth washing.::
27980::$$$message_0206_0056_0000$$$::"What about you?"[lr]::
27981::$$$message_0206_0056_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
27982::$$$message_0206_0056_0002$$$::"Does it feel good to have someone else wash your hair?"[lr]::
27983::$$$message_0206_0056_0003$$$::"I... Fuh... [cacheimage storage=fd21b][wvl canskip=0 time=200][fadein time=300 storage=fd21b textoff=0]Mmmm..."::
27984::$$$message_0206_0057_0000$$$::I listen to Rider's voice from up close, while slowly and gently massaging her scalp.[lr]::
27985::$$$message_0206_0057_0001$$$::I keep changing the tempo, like I'm petting a cat, amusing myself with her reactions.::
27986::$$$message_0206_0058_0000$$$::"Yes... It does feel good when you wash my hair."[lr]::
27987::$$$message_0206_0058_0001$$$::"Yeah? Good."[lr]::
27988::$$$message_0206_0058_0002$$$::"Mm... Hehehe..."::
27989::$$$message_0206_0059_0000$$$::I twist myself to address her hair flowing down to the floor.[lr]::
27990::$$$message_0206_0059_0001$$$::I drape it all over my left arm, and comb it with my soapy fingers.[lr]::
27991::$$$message_0206_0059_0002$$$::I keep spinning her satin, like a magic weaving loom.::
27992::$$$message_0206_0060_0000$$$::Her hair absorbs all the foam, so I add more shampoo from time to time.[lr]::
27993::$$$message_0206_0060_0001$$$::I think we've used quite a bit of Tohsaka's shampoo, but it can't be avoided given how much hair Rider has.::
27994::$$$message_0206_0061_0000$$$::"Does it itch anywhere, Miss?"[lr]::
27995::$$$message_0206_0061_0001$$$::"Not particularly, no... [cacheimage storage=fd21h][wvl canskip=0 time=200][fadein time=300 storage=fd21h textoff=0]Hehe, you're like a beautician."[lr]::
27996::$$$message_0206_0061_0002$$$::"Yeah. I'm starting to get the hang of this."[lr]::
27997::$$$message_0206_0061_0003$$$::"What about you? Are you not feeling any back pain from having to maintain your current posture?"[lr]::
27998::$$$message_0206_0061_0004$$$::"I'm okay. Since my lower half is rock hard right now, I feel as if I'm sitting down."[lr]::
27999::$$$message_0206_0061_0005$$$::"I see... [fadein time=300 storage=fd21b textoff=0]Huaah...mm..."::
28000::$$$message_0206_0062_0000$$$::"Mm...heh...hehe..."[lr]::
28001::$$$message_0206_0062_0001$$$::At some point, the weaving loom turns into a music box.[lr]::
28002::$$$message_0206_0062_0002$$$::Rider's hair seems to stretch on and on, like never-ending music.::
28003::$$$message_0206_0063_0000$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
28004::$$$message_0206_0063_0001$$$::Something tickles my palm.[lr]::
28005::$$$message_0206_0063_0002$$$::The sudsy hair slips and moves in a way I didn't expect.::
28006::$$$message_0206_0064_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
28007::$$$message_0206_0064_0001$$$::The hair is rippling in my arms to some kind of rhythm.[lr]::
28008::$$$message_0206_0064_0002$$$::I regretfully pause the music playing in my head and reach for the discordant notes.::
28009::$$$message_0206_0065_0000$$$::"Eh? Oh..."[lr]::
28010::$$$message_0206_0065_0001$$$::But the hair seems to have a life of its own, and it slithers out of my grasp.[lr]::
28011::$$$message_0206_0065_0002$$$::I chase it with my hands, but it keeps dodging between my left and right hands.::
28012::$$$message_0206_0066_0000$$$::...Then, I realize it isn't just one bundle of her hair.[lr]::
28013::$$$message_0206_0066_0001$$$::The hair is dancing all around me.::
28014::$$$message_0206_0067_0000$$$::"Hehe. That tickles. Shirou, I can wash my body on my own."[lr]::
28015::$$$message_0206_0067_0001$$$::"What?"[lr]::
28016::$$$message_0206_0067_0002$$$::"Mm... Haah, you're even touching me there? How bold."[lr]::
28017::$$$message_0206_0067_0003$$$::"W-w-w-what!?[lr]::
28018::$$$message_0206_0067_0004$$$::N-no I'm not! Aah, where the heck is this pervy hair going!?"::
28019::$$$message_0206_0068_0000$$$::It's like trying to catch an eel.[lr]::
28020::$$$message_0206_0068_0001$$$::No matter where I grab it, the hair keeps slipping through my fingers.[lr]::
28021::$$$message_0206_0068_0002$$$::Oh, right. Wasn't Medusa's hair...::
28022::$$$message_0206_0069_0000$$$::"Aah... They must be surprised by the shampoo."[lr]::
28023::$$$message_0206_0069_0001$$$::"Huh? Wuh, aaaah, ohhh?"[lr]::
28024::$$$message_0206_0069_0002$$$::"They must be embarrassed because you've been fondling them so gently."::
28025::$$$message_0206_0070_0000$$$::Rider giggles affably.[lr]::
28026::$$$message_0206_0070_0001$$$::I hug the wriggling, moving hair in my arms, not sure what to do with it, literally eating bubbles in confusion.::
28027::$$$message_0206_0071_0000$$$::"Rider?[lr]::
28028::$$$message_0206_0071_0001$$$::Sorry, but can you do something..."[lr]::
28029::$$$message_0206_0071_0002$$$::"Why, I'm not sure. I can't see anything, after all."[lr]::
28030::$$$message_0206_0071_0003$$$::"You aren't moving these things, are you?"::
28031::$$$message_0206_0072_0000$$$::"Perish the thought.[lr]::
28032::$$$message_0206_0072_0001$$$::You aren't touching me and trying to blame the hair for it, I hope."[lr]::
28033::$$$message_0206_0072_0002$$$::"Say what...!?"[lr]::
28034::$$$message_0206_0072_0003$$$::She knows full well I'm not! What a tease.::
28035::$$$message_0206_0073_0000$$$::"Ugh, enough. Okay..."[lr]::
28036::$$$message_0206_0073_0001$$$::Slowly, I start to get the hang of working with her hair.[lr]::
28037::$$$message_0206_0073_0002$$$::I hold one hand out where it tries to escape, and avoid squeezing it. [movefg opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=2500 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0]I let it rest, and if it starts to fall, I gently grab and support it with both arms.[lr]::
28038::$$$message_0206_0073_0003$$$::Like handling a snake, basically.::
28039::$$$message_0206_0074_0000$$$::"Whoa, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=15 hmax=5 time=500 count=3]ho, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=-15 hmax=10 time=600 count=3]oh, [wvl canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=20 time=700 count=3]ooh...[wvl canskip=0 time=600][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=25 time=800 count=4] How's that?"[lr]::
28040::$$$message_0206_0074_0001$$$::I don't have enough hands, so I use my back to support the hair.[lr]::
28041::$$$message_0206_0074_0002$$$::Once the hair stays still, I don't move either.[lr]::
28042::$$$message_0206_0074_0003$$$::I twist around like a snake handler, doing my best to let it get used to the physical contact.[lr]::
28043::$$$message_0206_0074_0004$$$::...So how am I supposed to start washing it again, exactly?::
28044::$$$message_0206_0075_0000$$$::"Hehehe..."[lr]::
28045::$$$message_0206_0075_0001$$$::Rider stifles her laughter, shoulders shaking, as if she's aware of my struggles.::
28046::$$$message_0206_0076_0000$$$::"Can you really not see anything?"[lr]::
28047::$$$message_0206_0076_0001$$$::"Not at all. So I won't have any idea where your eyes are looking."[lr]::
28048::$$$message_0206_0076_0002$$$::"Stup[line len=2]I-I told you, I'm not looking!"[lr]::
28049::$$$message_0206_0076_0003$$$::"Heh. I know."::
28050::$$$message_0206_0077_0000$$$::The hair escapes from my fingers in a new direction, this time aiming for my shoulders.::
28051::$$$message_0206_0078_0000$$$::"Oof... Ah!"[lr]::
28052::$$$message_0206_0078_0001$$$::The soapy hair laps at my skin, acting more like long tentacles than snakes.[lr]::
28053::$$$message_0206_0078_0002$$$::Before I know it, my arms are completely covered in hair.::
28054::$$$message_0206_0079_0000$$$::"Rider, I can't wash you like this."[lr]::
28055::$$$message_0206_0079_0001$$$::The wet hair is heavy, and I can barely lift my arms.[lr]::
28056::$$$message_0206_0079_0002$$$::In fact, my entire torso is bound up in them.::
28057::$$$message_0206_0080_0000$$$::"Ngh!"[lr]::
28058::$$$message_0206_0080_0001$$$::Without thinking, I try to turn around.[lr]::
28059::$$$message_0206_0080_0002$$$::Suddenly, an unexplainable current of pleasure rushes through my core.[lr]::
28060::$$$message_0206_0080_0003$$$::Rider's softly undulating hair is licking my back.::
28061::$$$message_0206_0081_0000$$$::"Whew, that's strange... It's almost as if I'm intoxicated."[lr]::
28062::$$$message_0206_0081_0001$$$::"Eh?"[lr]::
28063::$$$message_0206_0081_0002$$$::Rider leans against me. My upper half is covered in her hair, while my lower half is stone solid and can't move.::
28064::$$$message_0206_0082_0000$$$::"And yet I've never felt dizzy no matter how much alcohol I consume..."[lr]::
28065::$$$message_0206_0082_0001$$$::"So that's it... Because it's Tohsaka's."[lr]::
28066::$$$message_0206_0082_0002$$$::"Haah, what about Rin?"::
28067::$$$message_0206_0083_0000$$$::"The shampoo that I'm using on your hair is Tohsaka's.[lr]::
28068::$$$message_0206_0083_0001$$$::She told me before that a female mage's hair can be her last resort."[lr]::
28069::$$$message_0206_0083_0002$$$::And that her ribbons are superb magical items that keep the magical energy imbued in her hair stored.::
28070::$$$message_0206_0084_0000$$$::"So it might be that Tohsaka's shampoo has something special...[wvl][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=30 time=400 count=3] Whoa, whoa!"[lr]::
28071::$$$message_0206_0084_0001$$$::The ends of her hair slither into my armpits.[lr]::
28072::$$$message_0206_0084_0002$$$::Her foaming hair doesn't feel bad, exactly. I even like it, in a way, but[line len=2]that's tickling me pretty hard.[lr]::
28073::$$$message_0206_0084_0003$$$::Half of my body is turned to stone and immobile, and yet my body still stirs.::
28074::$$$message_0206_0085_0000$$$::"I seeee... Good...idea."[lr]::
28075::$$$message_0206_0085_0001$$$::"Wuhh...what idea?"[lr]::
28076::$$$message_0206_0085_0002$$$::"We don't even have to move...and the hair will wash itself...as well as your body...killing two birds with one stone."[lr]::
28077::$$$message_0206_0085_0003$$$::This is total locker room logic...wait, no time for that now.[lr]::
28078::$$$message_0206_0085_0004$$$::"That's such a sloppy...[wvl canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se063.wav][shock vmax=25 time=400 count=3] Waaah!"::
28079::$$$message_0206_0086_0000$$$::The swarm of hair swallows my fingers. Ah, I've been eaten.[playstop time=2500 nowait=1][lr]::
28080::$$$message_0206_0086_0001$$$::...Metaphorically, that is. I'm engulfed in her hair now. Somehow, a surprised yelp makes it out.::
28081::$$$message_0206_0087_0000$$$::"Hehe... Let me hear more of that, Shirou."[lr]::
28082::$$$message_0206_0087_0001$$$::I don't even get to ask what.[lr]::
28083::$$$message_0206_0087_0002$$$::Basically, Rider's a music box and I'm the cylinder within...::
28084::$$$message_0206_0088_0000$$$::"Wahh..."[lr]::
28085::$$$message_0206_0088_0001$$$::The gears keep turning.[lr]::
28086::$$$message_0206_0088_0002$$$::The teeth of the comb covering my whole body plays across every surface, drawing sounds out of me. Ticklish voices. Surprised voices.::
28087::$$$message_0206_0089_0000$$$::"Rider...ngh!"[lr]::
28088::$$$message_0206_0089_0001$$$::The gears keep turning.[lr]::
28089::$$$message_0206_0089_0002$$$::In the steamy bathroom, I'm tickled and surprised, making noises as I realize it's the hair doing this to me. My head goes blank.::
28090::$$$message_0206_0090_0000$$$::"Phew, no, I want more than just your voice...[lr]::
28091::$$$message_0206_0090_0001$$$::Show me more of your face...Shirou."[lr]::
28092::$$$message_0206_0090_0002$$$::Is Rider's blood circulation getting faster? Is she getting more intoxicated?[lr]::
28093::$$$message_0206_0090_0003$$$::She squints and presses her head against me.::
28094::$$$message_0206_0091_0000$$$::"Mm... Huah... Shirou, right there...I'm..."[lr]::
28095::$$$message_0206_0091_0001$$$::Rider's hair touches my splayed fingers that are trying to support her body.[lr]::
28096::$$$message_0206_0091_0002$$$::I try to put strength into them. It's like trying to catch a bale of hay.::
28097::$$$message_0206_0092_0000$$$::"Shirou... [wvl][se storage=se712.wav]Shirou..."[lr]::
28098::$$$message_0206_0092_0001$$$::Rider shakes her head, as if trying to ground[se storage=se063.wav] her mind again.[lr]::
28099::$$$message_0206_0092_0002$$$::Her pale throat arches backwards. Naturally, her hair moves in time with her head.[lr]::
28100::$$$message_0206_0092_0003$$$::The hair wrapping my whole body slithers. It tickles, or maybe hurts. I'm not sure anymore.::
28101::$$$message_0206_0093_0000$$$::My rational mind is whiting out.[lr]::
28102::$$$message_0206_0093_0001$$$::If this keeps up...::
28103::$$$message_0206_0094_0000$$$::"Hehe... Mmgh."[lr]::
28104::$$$message_0206_0094_0001$$$::Rider adds more shampoo on her own.[lr]::
28105::$$$message_0206_0094_0002$$$::The freshly lubricated snakes move even more intensely.::
28106::$$$message_0206_0095_0000$$$::"...Ngh, fuh...ngh!"[lr]::
28107::$$$message_0206_0095_0001$$$::I don't know what's going on, but I think the pain is getting worse. It's like my whole body is being skinned alive.[lr]::
28108::$$$message_0206_0095_0002$$$::All of my nerves feel raw, [movefg opacity=255 time=4000 pos=c accel=0 storage=white textoff=0]and I feel a sensation like cracks spreading through my supposedly petrified, numb body.::
28109::$$$message_0206_0096_0000$$$::"Hngh, nngh...!"[lr]::
28110::$$$message_0206_0096_0001$$$::I bite down hard, grinding down my molars.[lr]::
28111::$$$message_0206_0096_0002$$$::The whiteness continues to wipe out my mind, and my brain is boiling so hot it's going to evaporate, at this rate...[sestop time=2000 nowait=1][playstop time=2000 nowait=1][lr]::
28112::$$$message_0206_0096_0003$$$::Suddenly, I pass out.::
28113::$$$message_0206_0097_0000$$$::"...Ngh."[lr]::
28114::$$$message_0206_0097_0001$$$::I'm awoken by the sound of water. I realize I'm lying on the floor.[lr]::
28115::$$$message_0206_0097_0002$$$::At some point, I was released from the prison of hair.::
28116::$$$message_0206_0098_0000$$$::"Are you awake, Shirou?"[lr]::
28117::$$$message_0206_0098_0001$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
28118::$$$message_0206_0098_0002$$$::"My vision has recovered."[lr]::
28119::$$$message_0206_0098_0003$$$::"Oh... What about the petrification?"::
28120::$$$message_0206_0099_0000$$$::"No, Gorgon is still in effect. The vision loss was only temporary.[lr]::
28121::$$$message_0206_0099_0001$$$::Your petrification should lift soon."::
28122::$$$message_0206_0100_0000$$$::As Rider says, I'm starting to feel sensation return to my knees.[lr]::
28123::$$$message_0206_0100_0001$$$::I can't move them yet, but I should be able to walk soon enough.::
28124::$$$message_0206_0101_0000$$$::"Oh... Sorry. I was in the middle of washing your hair."[lr]::
28125::$$$message_0206_0101_0001$$$::"No, I went too far in my teasing as well... [fadein time=300 storage=fd21f]But, um, Shirou..."[lr]::
28126::$$$message_0206_0101_0002$$$::Rider looks away awkwardly.[lr]::
28127::$$$message_0206_0101_0003$$$::I look down at my recovering lower body...::
28128::$$$message_0206_0102_0000$$$::"GAHHHHH!"[lr]::
28129::$$$message_0206_0102_0001$$$::...and immediately cover it with the wash bucket.::
28130::$$$message_0206_0103_0000$$$::"...!"[lr]::
28131::$$$message_0206_0103_0001$$$::Cold water from the bucket soaks my lower half.[lr]::
28132::$$$message_0206_0103_0002$$$::The warping and cracking of thermal expansion reaches my brain, and the sudden intense sensations make me see white.[lr]::
28133::$$$message_0206_0103_0003$$$::What a shameful display.::
28134::$$$message_0206_0104_0000$$$::"No! It's not what you think!"[lr]::
28135::$$$message_0206_0104_0001$$$::"Right..."[lr]::
28136::$$$message_0206_0104_0002$$$::"It, um, it gets like that if anything touches it!"[lr]::
28137::$$$message_0206_0104_0003$$$::"Uh-huh..."::
28138::$$$message_0206_0105_0000$$$::"So I'm definitely not reacting to you or anything like that!"[lr]::
28139::$$$message_0206_0105_0001$$$::"Um...your staring is making me uncomfortable."[lr]::
28140::$$$message_0206_0105_0002$$$::"Ah, gah, sorry!"[lr]::
28141::$$$message_0206_0105_0003$$$::"No..."::
28142::$$$message_0206_0106_0000$$$::"Um, but I thought you said you didn't mind me looking..."[lr]::
28143::$$$message_0206_0106_0001$$$::"...Whether I'm a human or a Heroic Spirit, my body is still that of a woman, so in the end, I do find sexual shame difficult to overcome."[lr]::
28144::$$$message_0206_0106_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
28145::$$$message_0206_0106_0003$$$::"I remembered that because of how gentle you were with me."::
28146::$$$message_0206_0107_0000$$$::"Um..."[lr]::
28147::$$$message_0206_0107_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
28148::$$$message_0206_0107_0002$$$::"What do you mean?"[lr]::
28149::$$$message_0206_0107_0003$$$::"..."::
28150::$$$message_0206_0108_0000$$$::"...Shirou, you pervert."[lr]::
28151::$$$message_0206_0108_0001$$$::"Nn!?"[lr]::
28152::$$$message_0206_0108_0002$$$::My jaw falls open at that unexpected answer.::
28153::$$$message_0206_0109_0000$$$::"Thank you for today. Let's do this again another time."[lr]::
28154::$$$message_0206_0109_0001$$$::Rider wrings the water from her hair and gets up.[lr]::
28155::$$$message_0206_0109_0002$$$::She neatly snakes around me with her well-proportioned body, and my motionless and dumbstruck self just keeps staring at her.[lr]::
28156::$$$message_0206_0109_0003$$$::"!"[lr]::
28157::$$$message_0206_0109_0004$$$::Trailing behind her, her wet hair then nips me on the shoulder in greeting.::
28158::$$$message_0206_0110_0000$$$::...A few minutes later, I was completely released from the petrification.[lr]::
28159::$$$message_0206_0110_0001$$$::"Hmm...that's weird."[lr]::
28160::$$$message_0206_0110_0002$$$::My body still feels strangely itchy. I'm not sure if it's because of Rider's hair or Tohsaka's shampoo.[lr]::
28161::$$$message_0206_0110_0003$$$::It feels weird when I put my shirt on.::
28162::$$$message_0206_0111_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai. Did you finish taking a bath?"[lr]::
28163::$$$message_0206_0111_0001$$$::"AHHHH!"[lr]::
28164::$$$message_0206_0111_0002$$$::She barely brushes against my shoulder, sending countless ants running across my skin.::
28165::$$$message_0206_0112_0000$$$::"...!?"[lr]::
28166::$$$message_0206_0112_0001$$$::I try to grab the innumerable legs crawling under my skin, only to realize that I'm hugging myself.::
28167::$$$message_0206_0113_0000$$$::"Senpai...?"[lr]::
28168::$$$message_0206_0113_0001$$$::"UHHWOOAH!?"[lr]::
28169::$$$message_0206_0113_0002$$$::Sakura's palm on my back sends an electric current into me that makes my spine want to dance.[lr]::
28170::$$$message_0206_0113_0003$$$::My entire body instantly arches backward, like a clockwork toy.::
28171::$$$message_0206_0114_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28172::$$$message_0206_0114_0001$$$::"Haah, haah...!?"[lr]::
28173::$$$message_0206_0114_0002$$$::Sakura sticks a finger into my [shock vmax=30 time=800 count=2][se storage=se042.wav]outstretched chest, and...[lr]::
28174::$$$message_0206_0114_0003$$$::"OAHYAAAGH![wvl canskip=0 time=400] Shakuryah!"[lr]::
28175::$$$message_0206_0114_0004$$$::The centerline of my body itches like it's slowly being peeled open by a scalpel, and I let out a strangled, crazed voice.::
28176::$$$message_0206_0115_0000$$$::"Haah, haah, Sakura, don't touch me, wait..."[lr]::
28177::$$$message_0206_0115_0001$$$::"O-okay..."[lr]::
28178::$$$message_0206_0115_0002$$$::"Heeek, heeek, my skin is super sensitive..."[lr]::
28179::$$$message_0206_0115_0003$$$::"S-sorry."[lr]::
28180::$$$message_0206_0115_0004$$$::"Haah, hoo, no, it's okay, phew."::
28181::$$$message_0206_0116_0000$$$::"Um... What happened?"[lr]::
28182::$$$message_0206_0116_0001$$$::"Whew, well, uh, I think my body didn't like that new soap I tried."[lr]::
28183::$$$message_0206_0116_0002$$$::"...Huh."[lr]::
28184::$$$message_0206_0116_0003$$$::"Whew, I need to lie down. Phew."[lr]::
28185::$$$message_0206_0116_0004$$$::"Senpai..."[lr]::
28186::$$$message_0206_0116_0005$$$::"Whew, whew, hmm?"::
28187::$$$message_0206_0117_0000$$$::"Senpai... Aw... You're funny."[lr]::
28188::$$$message_0206_0117_0001$$$::Sakura is giving me a look of mischief.::
28189::$$$message_0206_0118_0000$$$::"Wah, g-good night, Sakura!"[lr]::
28190::$$$message_0206_0118_0001$$$::"Senpai[line len=2]huh!?"::
28191::$$$message_0206_0119_0000$$$::"Sniff sniff, I smell sadism.[lr]::
28192::$$$message_0206_0119_0001$$$::It's like when your grandfather on his deathbed said, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06c(中),藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中),藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中),i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜),藤fd特殊02c(中),white][wvl][rep fliplr=0 tops=136,, storages=イリヤ06c(中),藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中),藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) time=300 flipud=0 lefts=598,, poss=,c,c bg=i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 opacities=0,255,0][move time=140 path=(215,93,255)(215,61,255)(215,93,255)(215,61,255) storage=藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中) accel=-2][wm canskip=0][rep fliplr=0 tops=136,, storages=イリヤ06c(中),藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中),藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) time=100 flipud=0 lefts=598,, poss=,c,c bg=i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 opacities=0,0,255][se storage=se101.wav][move time=100 path=(-50,61,255)(16,61,255)(4,61,0) storage=藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) accel=-2][wait canskip=0 time=100][rep fliplr=0 tops=136,, storages=イリヤ06c(中),藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中),藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) time=100 flipud=0 lefts=598,, poss=,c,c bg=i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 opacities=0,255,0][wm canskip=0][rep fliplr=0 tops=136,, storages=イリヤ06c(中),藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中),藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) time=100 flipud=0 lefts=598,, poss=,c,c bg=i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 opacities=0,0,255][se storage=se101.wav][move time=150 path=(-50,61,255)(16,61,255)(4,61,0) storage=藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) accel=-2][wait canskip=0 time=100][rep fliplr=0 tops=136,, storages=イリヤ06c(中),藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中),藤fd特殊03_右ジャブb(中) time=100 flipud=0 lefts=598,, poss=,c,c bg=i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 opacities=0,255,0][wm canskip=0][move time=180 path=(215,93,255)(215,61,255)(215,93,255)(215,61,255) storage=藤fd特殊03_右構えb(中) accel=-2][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se325.wav][shock vmax=25 time=600 count=4][rep fliplr=0 tops=,136, storages=藤fd特殊02c(中),イリヤ06c(中),white time=300 flipud=0 lefts=,593,c poss=c,, bg=i衛宮邸_渡り廊下-(夜) indexes=1000,2000,3000 opacities=255,0,0]'lead the world by the nose!' and left a weird heirloom. Doesn't it remind you of the dream you had that day?"::
28193::$$$message_0206_0120_0000$$$::"Ding [cacheimage storage=イリヤ刻印01c(中)][wvl][se storage=se717.wav][movefg opacity=0 time=200 pos=r accel=0 storage=イリヤ刻印01c(中) textoff=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=180 time=300 pos=r accel=0 storage=イリヤ刻印01c(中) textoff=0][wm canskip=0]ding, [wvl canskip=0 time=600][clfg time=300 storage=イリヤ刻印01c(中) textoff=0]the radar just picked up Shirou's screaming. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ06f(中)][move time=195 path=(422,167,255)(459,136,255)(494,167,255)(459,136,255) storage=イリヤ06f(中) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]What's happening? What's happening?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
28194::$$$message_0206_0120_0001$$$::"The wacky duo!? OAHYAAAGH!"::
28195::$$$message_0206_0121_0000$$$::"Whoa, what?[lr]::
28196::$$$message_0206_0121_0001$$$::...Ahaha, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ03b(中),イリヤ03b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ03b(中)][move time=120 path=(350,20,255)(350,0,255)(350,28,255)(350,0,255) storage=イリヤ03b(中) accel=0 textoff=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ03b(近)b textoff=0 left=180][shock vmax=30 time=600 count=3][se storage=se040.wav]oh, Shirou! Take that!"[lr]::
28197::$$$message_0206_0121_0002$$$::"Illya, stopYEEAEEAAAAARGH!"::
28198::$$$message_0206_0122_0000$$$::"W-what a crazy noise you're making, Shirou![lr]::
28199::$$$message_0206_0122_0001$$$::I don't remember raising you to act like that!"[lr]::
28200::$$$message_0206_0122_0002$$$::"Haaagh! Foooji-nee!?"::
28201::$$$message_0206_0123_0000$$$::"Ah, Senpai!?"[lr]::
28202::$$$message_0206_0123_0001$$$::"Hyagh, Sakura, kuh, these two..."[lr]::
28203::$$$message_0206_0123_0002$$$::"No fair! Me too!"[lr]::
28204::$$$message_0206_0123_0003$$$::"[font italic=true]But why!?[font italic=false]"::
28205::$$$message_0206_0124_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28206::$$$message_0206_0124_0001$$$::"Rider, help! Rider!"[lr]::
28207::$$$message_0206_0124_0002$$$::"...None of my business."[lr]::
28208::$$$message_0206_0124_0003$$$::"Nooo, my lifeguard...!"::
28209::$$$message_0206_0125_0000$$$::"Nufu, you won't get away, Shirou! Prepare to fire!"[lr]::
28210::$$$message_0206_0125_0001$$$::"We're going with [font italic=true]that[font italic=false], right, Taiga? Ready!"::
28211::$$$message_0206_0126_0000$$$::"Kyudo Club Ultimate Technique! Tope Einzbern!"[lr]::
28212::$$$message_0206_0126_0001$$$::"Yoo-hoo! Big Brotherrr!"[wvs][wait canskip=0 time=200][lr]::
28213::$$$message_0206_0126_0002$$$::Fuji-nee grabs Illya's ankles and gives her a spin, then launches her like she's throwing a hammer.[lr]::
28214::$$$message_0206_0126_0003$$$::What does kyudo have to do with it!?::
28215::$$$message_0206_0127_0000$$$::"AAAYHYAAAROOOOGH!"[lr]::
28216::$$$message_0206_0127_0001$$$::"Got him! [cacheimage storage=イリヤ04b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ04b(近)][move time=150 path=(176,174,255)(145,156,255)(176,174,255)(208,156,255)(239,175,255)(271,157,255)(239,175,255)(208,156,255) storage=イリヤ04b(近) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]Look, look!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
28217::$$$message_0206_0127_0002$$$::"Ahyahyahya, hey, hyahyahya, stop..."::
28218::$$$message_0206_0128_0000$$$::"'But why?'"[cacheimage storage=イリヤ03b(近)b][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=100 storage=イリヤ03b(近)b opacity=0 textoff=0][lr]::
28219::$$$message_0206_0128_0001$$$::"'But why!'"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
28220::$$$message_0206_0128_0002$$$::"Stop copying me, AHYAHYAHYAHYAHYAAAOOH!"[lr]::
28221::$$$message_0206_0128_0003$$$::Illya gets carried away and [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=300][movefg opacity=200 left=-90 top=-268 time=1500 accel=-2 storage=シネスコw1000a textoff=0][movefg opacity=200 left=-94 top=370 time=1500 accel=-2 storage=シネスコw1000b textoff=0][movefg opacity=180 left=-160 top=0 time=1000 accel=0 storage=特殊白2a textoff=0]straddles my back, [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=300]starts giving me the [wait canskip=0 time=100]coochie-coochie-coo[movefg opacity=255 left=-103 top=-200 time=2000 accel=-2 storage=シネスコw1000a textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-94 top=300 time=2000 accel=-2 storage=シネスコw1000b textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-160 top=0 time=1000 accel=0 storage=特殊白2a textoff=0][wait canskip=0 time=300][line len=3]oh [wait canskip=0 time=200]no[wait canskip=0 time=200], [wait canskip=0 time=300]I [wait canskip=0 time=200]can't[wait canskip=0 time=200]...!::
28222::$$$message_0206_0129_0000$$$::"Ah... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]He stopped moving."[lr]::
28223::$$$message_0206_0129_0001$$$::"KO! That's pathetic, Shirou!"[wvs][se storage=se452.wav][wait canskip=0 time=400]::

